		}
		{
			dependencies: ["054CDC18C3A87BDD"]
			description: [
				"&eIntegrated Tunnels&r is what turns all that logic into movement."
				""
				"&eImporters&r pull out of an inventory, &eExporters&r push into one - but unlike a pipe, each one can be driven by a variable. \"Export iron only while the furnace buffer is under 16.\" \"Import from the sieve only when the drawer isn't full.\""
				""
				"These are &oparts&r: place them onto a Logic Cable, not as standalone blocks."
			]
			icon: "integratedtunnels:part_exporter_item"
			id: "07EA52F629E3F2E5"
			rewards: [{
				id: "150B6BDFF729B973"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Movement, driven by logic"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "28964609EBEF7900"
					item: "integratedtunnels:part_importer_item"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "308C74F988C4826A"
