			x: -8.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7A4291CCD32CAFEF"]
			description: [
				"The &eProgrammer&r is the best-looking automation UI in the pack, and the most fun."
				""
				"You drag &opuzzle pieces&r into a program - &7go to area&r, &7dig block&r, &7place block&r, &7pick up item&r, &7craft&r, &7harvest&r - and snap them together into a flight plan. No syntax, no text, just shapes that fit or don't."
				""
				"Build the program here. The thing that runs it comes next."
			]
			icon: "pneumaticcraft:programmer"
			id: "164AB36A0A638226"
			rewards: [{
				id: "6585856BAB28035F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Automation as a jigsaw"
			tasks: [{
				id: "14A4944BA00D0B14"
				item: "pneumaticcraft:programmer"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&bThe Programmer"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["164AB36A0A638226"]
			description: [
				"Slot a program into a &eDrone&r, give it a &eCharging Station&r to sip pressure from, and let it go."
				""
				"It will fly out and do the job - farm a field, clear an area, ferry items between chests, chase mobs off the island - and come home to recharge. No pipes, no cables, no channels. Just a small machine that knows what you asked for."
				""
				"&7Specialised drones exist too: Harvesting, Logistics, Collector and Guard drones come pre-programmed if you'd rather skip the jigsaw."
			]
			icon: "pneumaticcraft:drone"
			id: "3486F30F73E53018"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "562B7A2D9360C7D1"
